{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50705","headline":"谢高燕公惠生衣 · 张祜","name":"谢高燕公惠生衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高公宠岁赐白衣裳，惊讶灾天雪满箱。\n乍展轻烟总手滑，如披薄雾觉身凉。\n谁家纤素秋蟾色，何处丝抽嫩异香？\n珍重六铢无可赠，空凭七字当琼浆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}